2. For CLASS- You will get all the fields whose locator CLASS has that value
-> .value


3. For NAME- You will get all the fields whose locator CLASS has that value
-> [NAME='value']
-> ex. [name='username'] 

4. For LINK_TEXT- Finding element by giving entire text visible on the UI for a hyperlink

5. PARTIAL_LINK_TEXT: Finding element by giving partail text from entire text visible on the UI
for a hyperlink

